{"symbol":"SENSEXBEES","yahoo":"SENSEXBEES.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Nippon Mutual Funds - Nippon India ETF S&P BSE Sensex","sector":"","industry":null,"website":null,"about":"Nippon Mutual Funds - Nippon India ETF S&P BSE Sensex is an exchange traded fund launched by Reliance Capital Ltd. It is managed by Reliance Capital Asset Management Limited. The fund invests in the public equity markets of India. It seeks to invest in the stocks of companies operating across diversified sectors. The fund invests in the stocks of large-cap companies. It seeks to replicate the performance of the S&P BSE Sensex Index, by investing in the stocks of companies as per their weightings in the index. The fund was formerly known as Nippon Mutual Funds - Nippon ETF Sensex. Nippon Mutual Funds - Nippon India ETF S&P BSE Sensex was formed on September 17, 2014 and is domiciled in India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:56:18+00:00","quote":{"price":850.21,"prevClose":851.72,"marketCap":null,"high52":990.0,"low52":819.01,"pe":null,"bookValue":null,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":null,"insiders":null,"institutions":null},"prices":{"dates":["2016-10-03","2016-10-06","2016-10-18","2016-11-08","2016-12-06","2017-01-04","2017-01-10","2017-01-17","2017-02-14","2017-02-28","2017-03-01","2017-03-03","2017-03-06","2017-03-15","2017-03-16","2017-03-17","2017-03-24","2017-04-05","2017-04-17","2017-04-25","2017-04-26","2017-04-27","2017-05-04","2017-05-09","2017-05-15","2017-05-24","2017-05-25","2017-05-26","2017-05-29","2017-05-30","2017-06-05","2017-06-06","2017-06-08","2017-06-27","2017-07-04","2017-07-07","2017-07-10","2017-07-11","2017-07-12","2017-07-13","2017-07-21","2017-07-24","2017-07-27","2017-08-08","2017-08-10","2017-08-28","2017-09-06","2017-09-19","2017-09-25","2017-09-27","2017-10-13","2017-10-18","2017-10-25","2017-10-27","2017-11-02","2017-11-03","2017-11-10","2017-11-27","2017-11-29","2017-12-20","2017-12-27","2018-01-02","2018-01-04","2018-01-05","2018-01-09","2018-01-15",